{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50768","headline":"冬日幷州道中寄荆门舍 · 张祜","name":"冬日幷州道中寄荆门舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣明神武尚营边，我是何人不控弦。\n身着貂裘随十万，心思白社隔三千。\n云沉古戍初寒日，鴈下平陂欲雪天。\n却爲恩深归未得，许随车骑勒燕然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}